  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> An alchemical coating adds a separate 1d4 Acid damage roll to a friendly ally's attack against a hostile creature that is already bloodied. It only applies when the target is at or below half HP.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
